---
import { MoreVertical } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section class="bg-surface-alt py-16 lg:py-24" id="producto">
  <div class="container-page flex flex-col items-center gap-12">
    <!-- Copy principal -->
    <div class="flex max-w-[1000px] flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center" data-reveal>
      <h1
        class="text-[36px] leading-[1.14] font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink text-balance sm:text-[44px] lg:text-[56px]"
      >
        Escríbele a tu web como le escribirías a tu agencia.
      </h1>

      <p class="max-w-[620px] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-body text-balance lg:text-[18px]">
        Haz tu petición en lenguaje natural por Telegram. La IA interpreta, ejecuta y te
        muestra el resultado. Tú apruebas con un sí.
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-brand lg:text-[16px]">
        Cambios seguros, en minutos y aprobados por ti.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="#contacto"
          class="rounded-md bg-brand px-6 py-[15px] text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink-deep transition-colors hover:bg-brand-dark hover:text-white"
        >
          Solicitar acceso
        </a>
        <a
          href="#flujo"
          class="rounded-md border border-line-strong bg-surface px-6 py-[15px] text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-ink"
        >
          Ver cómo funciona
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mockup operativo: 3 pasos -->
    <div class="grid w-full max-w-[1120px] gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3" data-reveal>
      <!-- Card 1 — Tú pides -->
      <article
        class="flex min-h-[460px] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line-cool bg-surface"
      >
        <header class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-telegram px-4 py-[13px]">
          <span
            class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0F52BA] text-[14px] font-bold text-white"
            aria-hidden="true">B</span
          >
          <span class="flex flex-1 flex-col leading-tight">
            <span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-white">Binflow Bot</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-white/80">en línea</span>
          </span>
          <MoreVertical class="size-[18px] text-white/80" aria-hidden="true" />
        </header>

        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-3">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1">
            <p
              class="max-w-[240px] rounded-lg rounded-br-sm bg-[#2DD4BF] px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-ink"
            >
              Actualiza el hero del sitio con el nuevo copy: Transformando pagos en la
              nube. Agrega las métricas +40% conversión y &lt; 50ms latencia.
            </p>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-ink/70">14:32 ✓✓</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-end gap-2">
            <span
              class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-telegram text-[10px] font-bold text-white"
              aria-hidden="true">B</span
            >
            <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-1">
              <p
                class="max-w-[230px] rounded-lg rounded-bl-sm bg-[#F1F5F9] px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-ink"
              >
                Entendido. Voy a actualizar el hero con el nuevo copy y métricas.
                ¿Confirmas para generar el preview?
              </p>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-ink/70">14:32</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line-cool px-3 py-2.5">
          <span
            class="flex size-[18px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-ink-deep"
            >1</span
          >
          <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#374151]">Tú pides</span>
        </footer>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 2 — Ves el resultado real -->
      <article
        class="flex min-h-[460px] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line-cool bg-surface"
      >
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 bg-success py-[6px] font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.08em] text-white"
        >
          <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-white" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          PREVIEW LISTO
        </div>

        <!-- Barra del navegador -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line-cool px-3 py-[11px]">
          <span class="flex gap-1" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[#FF5F57]"></span>
            <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[#FEBC2E]"></span>
            <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[#28C840]"></span>
          </span>
          <span
            class="flex flex-1 items-center gap-1.5 rounded bg-surface-soft px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#333D4F]"
          >
            <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-success" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            preview-stg.binflow.dev
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Mini-sitio -->
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col">
          <div
            class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line-cool px-4 py-3"
          >
            <span class="text-[13px] font-bold text-brand">BinFlow</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-[10px] text-[#94A3B8]">Producto</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-[#94A3B8]">Precios</span>
              <span
                class="rounded bg-telegram px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-white"
                >Empezar</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 px-5 py-8">
            <span
              class="rounded-full border border-brand/40 bg-brand/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[9px] font-semibold text-brand"
            >
              NUEVO → Integración Stripe
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-center text-[18px] font-bold text-slate-ink text-balance">
              Transformando pagos en la nube
            </h3>
            <div class="flex items-stretch gap-5">
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5">
                <span class="font-mono text-[22px] font-bold text-brand">+40%</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-[#94A3B8]">Conversión web</span>
              </div>
              <span class="w-px bg-line-cool" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5">
                <span class="font-mono text-[22px] font-bold text-surface-soft"
                  >&lt; 50ms</span
                >
                <span class="text-[10px] text-[#94A3B8]">Latencia API</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line-cool px-3 py-2.5">
          <span
            class="flex size-[18px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-ink-deep"
            >2</span
          >
          <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#374151]">Ves el resultado real</span
          >
        </footer>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 3 — Apruebas y listo -->
      <article
        class="flex min-h-[460px] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line-cool bg-surface"
      >
        <header class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-telegram px-4 py-[13px]">
          <span
            class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0F52BA] text-[14px] font-bold text-white"
            aria-hidden="true">B</span
          >
          <span class="flex flex-1 flex-col leading-tight">
            <span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-white">Binflow Bot</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-white/80">en línea</span>
          </span>
          <span
            class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-success px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold text-white"
          >
            <span class="size-1 rounded-full bg-white" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            EN VIVO
          </span>
        </header>

        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-3">
          <div class="flex items-end gap-2">
            <span
              class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-telegram text-[10px] font-bold text-white"
              aria-hidden="true">B</span
            >
            <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-1">
              <p
                class="max-w-[230px] rounded-lg rounded-bl-sm bg-[#EEEFF1] px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-ink"
              >
                Preview listo. Revisa los cambios aquí: preview-stg.binflow.dev ¿Apruebas
                para publicar?
              </p>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-ink/70">14:33</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1">
            <p
              class="rounded-lg rounded-br-sm bg-[#2DD4BF] px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-ink"
            >
              Sí, publica. 🚀
            </p>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-ink/70">14:33 ✓✓</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-end gap-2">
            <span
              class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-telegram text-[10px] font-bold text-white"
              aria-hidden="true">B</span
            >
            <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-1">
              <p
                class="max-w-[230px] rounded-lg rounded-bl-sm border border-success/40 bg-[#E7F8F2] px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-ink"
              >
                ✓ Publicado exitosamente. Los cambios ya están en vivo.
              </p>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-ink/70">14:33</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line-cool px-3 py-2.5">
          <span
            class="flex size-[18px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-white"
            >3</span
          >
          <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#374151]">Apruebas y listo</span>
        </footer>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
